This distribution includes a source patch for slipstream, originally developed
by Dwijen Patel and contributors and distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
The patch is an ElasticUMA modification; the bootstrap retrieves the unmodified
upstream source at its pinned commit before applying it. Upstream notices and
copyrights remain in the reconstructed source tree.

FreeToken informed the edge-MoE problem framing and public onboarding, but no
FreeToken source code is included or required.

Research papers, Python/Swift dependencies, and model checkpoints retain their
own copyrights and licenses. No model weights are distributed.
